## Name of the node
## Use RELEASE_NODE environment variable to override
## Format: name@host
## For Docker Swarm: RELEASE_NODE=a2a1@a2a-1
## The start script will substitute RELEASE_NODE from environment
## Default to a2a@127.0.0.1 if not set

## Cookie for distributed erlang
## Use RELEASE_COOKIE environment variable to override
## The start script will substitute RELEASE_COOKIE from environment
## Default to a2a_cookie if not set

## Heartbeat management
## Disabled by default to avoid unexpected restarts
## +K true

## Enable SMP
+S 4:4

## Increase number of concurrent ports/sockets
+Q 65536

## Increase process count
+P 1000000

## Enable kernel poll
+K true

## Schedulers online
## +sbt ns

## Use async threads
+A 64

## Garbage collection
+hms 233

## Allocator settings for memory efficiency
+MBas aobf
+MBlmbcs 512
+MEas aobf
